<Bindings>
	<!-- Shatter Next (#35): a key clicks the secure button like the left mouse
	     button, through the same PreClick/PostClick path. The client loads
	     this file from the addon folder by name, never from the TOC. The label
	     is the BINDING_NAME_* global set in UI/MainFrame.lua. -->
